{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t香港金融科技周在會展舉行，行政長官李家超致辭時表示，香港擁有內聯外通優勢，他有信心香港可助力企業向全球擴展。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n出席同一場合的財政司司長陳茂波表示，香港的監管框架緊貼創新步伐，以確保金融市場，能夠在穩固的基礎上發展。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:01:17.680311+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:33:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:18:43.619972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:58:34.080394+00:00","content_hash":"62d4dc735e821ad80ace32ee81a2e9e3b808bbbc482800ccc6a34e25fe4fa77b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}